WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.255
Buying property in Ontario is a lot. Titled makes it simple.

00:00:05.355 --> 00:00:09.786
A house, a condo, or land. On your own, or with people you trust.

00:00:10.730 --> 00:00:14.303
Every listing comes straight from REALTOR.ca, live.

00:00:14.453 --> 00:00:17.825
And on each one, you’ll see the price split between your buyers,

00:00:17.755 --> 00:00:20.634
what it could rent for, and the monthly mortgage.

00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:23.102
Then, pick your group.

00:00:23.252 --> 00:00:26.584
Invite family or friends, up to 49 of them.

00:00:26.684 --> 00:00:28.439
Everyone gets their own share,

00:00:28.339 --> 00:00:31.948
and sees exactly what they’ll pay before anyone commits.

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:35.488
When you’re ready, our registered agent makes the offer,

00:00:35.388 --> 00:00:39.540
and negotiates for you. And a real estate lawyer checks the title.

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:41.435
Need a mortgage?

00:00:41.535 --> 00:00:46.195
Our licensed partner shops the big banks, credit unions, and private lenders,

00:00:46.095 --> 00:00:47.756
whatever your credit score.

00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:53.258
On closing day, everyone goes on title with their own percentage.

00:00:53.409 --> 00:00:56.773
Live in it, rent it out, or sell your share down the road.

00:00:57.580 --> 00:01:02.161
One flat fee. $999, split between you.

00:01:02.411 --> 00:01:04.849
That’s Titled. Own it together.
